## 4. Error Handling Matrix

| Category | Trigger | HTTP Status | DB Write? | UI Behavior | Validates |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `auth` / `permission` | Missing session, invalid nonce, or insufficient capability/RLS | `401` / `403` | No | Show access-denied or session-expired banner | `Req 2.2` |
| `validation` | Missing required field or out-of-bounds input | `400` / `422` | No | Highlight invalid field(s) and preserve user input | `Req 1.3` |
| `persistence` | Database / external service failure after valid input | `500` | No (atomic) | Show retryable error toast/banner; preserve user input | `Req 1.3` |

